# The relay's image (Dockerfile) copies pyproject.toml, README.md and nanomuse_cloud/ only.
# The rest never enters the build context: the database and the uploads under data/, the
# .env with the keys, the deploy recipes, the tests and the caches. A pattern without `**/`
# matches at the root only (Go's filepath.Match, not gitignore).
.env
.env.*
data/
deploy/
tests/
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
